### 0. data_sources id 가져오기
GET https://api.notion.com/v1/databases/링크
Authorization: Bearer 토큰
Notion-Version: 2026-03-11

### 1. 기존 향수 스캔 테스트 (마스터 DB 조회 -> 착향 로그 Insert)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/logs/scan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "5A:A5:B9:5A:1E:41:89"
}

### 2. 신규 향수 등록 테스트 (마스터 DB Insert -> 착향 로그 Insert)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/perfumes/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "NEW:TEST:UID:123",
  "name": "Le Labo Santal 33",
  "brand": "Le Labo",
  "notes": ["Sandalwood", "Cedar", "Leather"],
  "url": "https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Le-Labo/Santal-33-12201.html",
  "imageUrl": "https://fimgs.net/mdig/perfume.12201.jpg"
}

### 프레그런티카 크롤링 테스트 (Playwright 스텔스 모드 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/perfumes/crawl?url=https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Goldfield-Banks-Australia/Ingenious-Ginger-81895.html
Accept: application/json

### 프레그런티카 크롤링 테스트 (Playwright 스텔스 모드 확인)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/perfumes/crawl?url=https://www.fragrantica.com/perfume/Lush/Devil-s-Night-Cap-17621.html
Accept: application/json

##############################################################################

### 1. 유저 로그인 테스트
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "new_user",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. 회원가입 테스트 (아래 API 구현 후 실행)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "new_user",
  "password": "password123"
}